customer: office_girl
problem: desktop_prank
brief:
	A colleague's prank (desktop_prank).
	Special event, the Skater jumpscare: while the player works on the Hat guy's hardware, the Skater pops up from behind the counter, as if he had hidden there: "Is my computer done?" When the player zooms out, he stands as usual; a short talk, "OK, I'll wait", and he leaves.

== drop-off
(neutral) Hi. I hope you can help, I have a report due.
+ Busy at the office?
	(irritated01) Always. And someone thinks pranks are a business strategy.
+ So, what's your problem?
	(problem) All the colours on my computer have changed. Black and yellow everywhere. I can't read a thing.
	+ Did someone use it?
		(thinking) I left it on over lunch. When I came back, it looked like this.
	- OK, leave it with me. [end]
		(neutral) Thank you. Please make it normal again.

== pick-up
(happy) Normal colours! You're a lifesaver.
